Package: SenSmooth
Title: Thiel-Sen and Siegel Smooth Methods
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Daniel", "Nidzgorski", , "dnidz@civiceco.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This package makes two median-based smooth methods from the 'mblm' package available for use in ggplot2::geom_smooth(): the Thiel-Sen median slope and the Siegel nested-median slope. 
